      *****************************************************************
      * CABCTC01 - CARRIER TRAFFIC CONSOLIDATION AND USAGE SUMMARY    *
      * APPLICATION : CABS                                            *
      * INPUTS      : DDNAME  DSN                          COPYBOOK   *
      *               USGIN   TELCABS.CABS.USAGE.EDIT(0)   CABSCDR    *
      *               CARRMST TELCABS.CABS.CARRIER         CABSCARR   *
      * OUTPUTS     : DDNAME  DSN                          COPYBOOK   *
      *               SUMOUT  TELCABS.CABS.CTCSUMM(+1)     (LOCAL)    *
      *               SUSOUT  TELCABS.CABS.CTC.SUSP(+1)    CABSERR    *
      *               RPTOUT  SYSOUT CLASS A               CABSPRNT   *
      * CONTROL     : CTLOUT                               CABSCTL    *
      * BALANCE     : CT-READ = CT-WRITTEN + CT-REJECTED +            *
      *               CT-SUMMARISED + CT-CARRIED-FWD                  *
      * RESTART     : FULL RERUN - THE SUMMARY IS REBUILT FROM THE    *
      *               EDITED USAGE FILE ON EVERY RUN                  *
      * REVISION HISTORY                                              *
      *   V1.00  1988-09-19  R.T.WHEELER  INITIAL RELEASE - CARRIER   *
      *                      TRAFFIC CONSOLIDATION FOR THE REGIONAL   *
      *                      ACCESS BILLING CENTRES                   *
      *   V1.02  1992-03-06  D.OKONKWO    CARRIER MASTER MOVED TO     *
      *                      VSAM KSDS, IN-CORE TABLE LOAD ADDED      *
      *   V1.04  1995-07-24  D.OKONKWO    JURISDICTION BUCKETS SPLIT  *
      *                      THREE WAYS INSTEAD OF TWO                *
      *   V1.06  1999-10-12  J.M.CASTILLO SUSPENSE WRITE ADDED FOR AN *
      *                      UNKNOWN OCN - PREVIOUSLY DROPPED SILENTLY
      *   V1.07  2004-06-08  P.NAIR       MOU THRESHOLD GUARD ADDED   *
      *                      AFTER THE MARCH REGIONAL OVERSTATEMENT   *
      *   V1.08  2011-02-15  A.BUKOWSKI   CONTROL BREAK REWRITTEN TO  *
      *                      THREE LEVELS - OCN, BAN, RATE ELEMENT    *
      *****************************************************************
       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CABCTC01.
       AUTHOR. TELCABS APPLICATIONS - CARRIER TRAFFIC.
      *****************************************************************
      * CARRIER TRAFFIC CONSOLIDATION.  READS THE EDITED WHOLESALE    *
      * ACCESS USAGE FILE IN OCN / BAN / RATE ELEMENT SEQUENCE AND    *
      * PRODUCES ONE SUMMARY RECORD PER RATE ELEMENT WITHIN BAN       *
      * WITHIN OCN, CARRYING THE THREE JURISDICTION MINUTE BUCKETS    *
      * AND THE DETAIL COUNT THAT THE RATING SUITE LATER PROVES       *
      * AGAINST.  THE CARRIER MASTER IS LOADED INTO CORE ONCE AT      *
      * INITIALISATION - THE FILE IS SMALL AND A KEYED READ PER       *
      * DETAIL RECORD WAS COSTING MORE THAN THE WHOLE STEP.           *
      *                                                               *
      * THE SUMMARY MINUTE BUCKETS ARE ACCUMULATED IN THE ORDER THE   *
      * DETAIL ARRIVES.  DO NOT RESEQUENCE THE INPUT BEFORE THIS      *
      * STEP - THE PROOF FILE THAT CABBIL11 READS IS BUILT ON THE     *
      * SAME ARRIVAL ORDER AND WILL NOT AGREE IF IT IS CHANGED.       *
      *****************************************************************
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
       SPECIAL-NAMES.
           C01 IS TO-NEW-PAGE.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT USGIN ASSIGN TO UT-S-USGIN
               ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL
               ACCESS MODE IS SEQUENTIAL
               FILE STATUS IS WS-FS-INPUT.
           SELECT CARRMST ASSIGN TO DA-CARRMST
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
               ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS CR-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS WS-FS-TABLE.
           SELECT SUMOUT ASSIGN TO UT-S-SUMOUT
               ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL
               ACCESS MODE IS SEQUENTIAL
               FILE STATUS IS WS-FS-OUTPUT.
           SELECT SUSOUT ASSIGN TO UT-S-SUSOUT
               ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL
               ACCESS MODE IS SEQUENTIAL
               FILE STATUS IS WS-FS-SUSPENSE.
           SELECT CTLOUT ASSIGN TO UT-S-CTLOUT
               ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL
               ACCESS MODE IS SEQUENTIAL
               FILE STATUS IS WS-FS-CONTROL.
           SELECT RPTOUT ASSIGN TO UT-S-RPTOUT
               ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL
               ACCESS MODE IS SEQUENTIAL
               FILE STATUS IS WS-FS-OUTPUT.
       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
      * USGIN - EDITED WHOLESALE ACCESS USAGE.  SEQUENCED BY THE
      * SORT STEP THAT PRECEDES THIS PROGRAM IN THE JOB.
       FD  USGIN
           RECORDING MODE IS F
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD
           BLOCK CONTAINS 0 RECORDS
           RECORD CONTAINS 200 CHARACTERS.
       COPY CABSCDR.
      * CARRMST - CARRIER (OCN) MASTER, VSAM KSDS.  BROWSED ONCE.
       FD  CARRMST
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       COPY CABSCARR.
      * SUMOUT - ONE RECORD PER RATE ELEMENT WITHIN BAN WITHIN OCN.
       FD  SUMOUT
           RECORDING MODE IS F
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD
           BLOCK CONTAINS 0 RECORDS
           RECORD CONTAINS 200 CHARACTERS.
       01  CABS-CTCS-RECORD.
           05  CS-KEY.
               10  CS-OCN                  PIC X(04).
               10  CS-BAN                  PIC X(13).
               10  CS-RATE-ELEM            PIC X(06).
           05  CS-CONTEXT.
               10  CS-CYCLE-YYDDD          PIC 9(05).
               10  CS-SITE-CD              PIC X(04).
               10  CS-CARRIER-TYPE         PIC X(01).
               10  CS-STATE-CD             PIC X(02).
           05  CS-COUNTS.
               10  CS-DETAIL-CNT           PIC S9(09) COMP-3.
               10  CS-SUSPECT-CNT          PIC S9(05) COMP-3.
           05  CS-MINUTES.
               10  CS-MOU-INTERSTATE       PIC S9(13)V9(02) COMP-3.
               10  CS-MOU-INTRASTATE       PIC S9(13)V9(02) COMP-3.
               10  CS-MOU-LOCAL            PIC S9(13)V9(02) COMP-3.
               10  CS-MOU-TOTAL            PIC S9(13)V9(02) COMP-3.
           05  CS-HASH.
               10  CS-HASH-SEQ             PIC S9(17) COMP-3.
               10  CS-HASH-OCN             PIC S9(15) COMP-3.
           05  CS-FILLER                   PIC X(108).
      * SUSOUT - SUSPENSE.  ONE RECORD PER REJECTED DETAIL.
       FD  SUSOUT
           RECORDING MODE IS F
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD
           BLOCK CONTAINS 0 RECORDS
           RECORD CONTAINS 300 CHARACTERS.
       01  CABS-SUSOUT-RECORD              PIC X(300).
      * CTLOUT - RUN CONTROL / BALANCING RECORD.
       FD  CTLOUT
           RECORDING MODE IS F
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD
           BLOCK CONTAINS 0 RECORDS
           RECORD CONTAINS 180 CHARACTERS.
       01  CABS-CTLOUT-RECORD              PIC X(180).
      * RPTOUT - CONSOLIDATION AUDIT REPORT.
       FD  RPTOUT
           RECORDING MODE IS FA
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD
           BLOCK CONTAINS 0 RECORDS
           RECORD CONTAINS 133 CHARACTERS.
       COPY CABSPRNT.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
      * STANDARD SHARED WORKING STORAGE.  SEE CABSWRK.
       COPY CABSWRK.
       01  WS-PROGRAM-CONSTANTS.
           05  WS-PGM-NAME                 PIC X(08) VALUE 'CABCTC01'.
           05  WS-PGM-VERSION              PIC X(05) VALUE 'V1.08'.
           05  WS-MAX-CARRIERS             PIC S9(04) COMP-3
                                                        VALUE 400.
