       01  WS-PARM-CARD                    PIC X(80).
       01  WS-PARM-CARD-R1 REDEFINES WS-PARM-CARD.
           05  PC1-REC-ID                   PIC X(02).
           05  PC1-RUN-ID                   PIC X(12).
           05  PC1-CYCLE-YYDDD              PIC 9(05).
           05  PC1-BILL-PERIOD              PIC 9(06).
           05  PC1-SITE-CD                  PIC X(04).
           05  PC1-JOBNAME                  PIC X(08).
           05  PC1-STEPNAME                 PIC X(08).
           05  PC1-OPT-SUSPEND              PIC X(01).
           05  PC1-OPT-REPORT               PIC X(01).
           05  PC1-FILLER                   PIC X(33).
       01  WS-PARM-CARD-R2 REDEFINES WS-PARM-CARD.
           05  PC2-HEADER                   PIC X(19).
           05  PC2-PERIOD-VIEW.
               10  PC2-PV-YY                PIC 9(02).
               10  PC2-PV-DDD               PIC 9(03).
           05  PC2-TRAILER                  PIC X(58).
      * CARRIER TABLE - LOADED ONCE FROM CARRMST.  SEARCHED WITH A
