               10  WS-CT-DEFAULT-PIU       PIC S9(03)V9(05) COMP-3.
               10  WS-CT-RECIP-ELIG        PIC X(01).
               10  WS-CT-EFF-YYDDD         PIC 9(05).
               10  WS-CT-EXP-YYDDD         PIC 9(05).
      * CONTROL BREAK KEYS.  THREE LEVELS SINCE V1.08.
