           05  WS-CURR-KEY.
               10  WS-CK-OCN               PIC X(04) VALUE SPACES.
               10  WS-CK-BAN               PIC X(13) VALUE SPACES.
               10  WS-CK-ELEM              PIC X(06) VALUE SPACES.
           05  WS-PREV-KEY.
               10  WS-PK-OCN               PIC X(04) VALUE SPACES.
               10  WS-PK-BAN               PIC X(13) VALUE SPACES.
               10  WS-PK-ELEM              PIC X(06) VALUE SPACES.
       01  WS-BREAK-KEYS-R REDEFINES WS-BREAK-KEYS.
           05  WS-BK-CURR-FULL             PIC X(23).
           05  WS-BK-PREV-FULL             PIC X(23).
       01  WS-BREAK-SWITCHES.
           05  WS-BREAK-SW                 PIC X(01) VALUE 'N'.
               88  WS-BREAK-TAKEN          VALUE 'Y'.
               88  WS-NO-BREAK             VALUE 'N'.
           05  WS-BREAK-LEVEL              PIC 9(01) VALUE 0.
               88  WS-BRK-NONE             VALUE 0.
               88  WS-BRK-ELEM             VALUE 1.
               88  WS-BRK-BAN              VALUE 2.
               88  WS-BRK-OCN              VALUE 3.
      * LEVEL ACCUMULATORS.  THE ELEMENT LEVEL IS WHAT IS WRITTEN.
