                                                            VALUE 0.
           05  WS-RW-OUT-MINUTES           PIC S9(13)V9(02) COMP-3
                                                            VALUE 0.
           05  WS-RW-CARRY                 PIC S9(01)V9(05) COMP-3
                                                            VALUE 0.
      * VALIDATION WORK AND LOCAL SWITCHES.
       01  WS-VALIDATION-WORK.
