           05  WS-VAL-REASON               PIC X(04) VALUE SPACES.
           05  WS-CARRIER-FOUND-SW         PIC X(01) VALUE 'N'.
               88  WS-CARRIER-FOUND        VALUE 'Y'.
               88  WS-CARRIER-NOT-FOUND    VALUE 'N'.
           05  WS-CARRIER-SUB              PIC S9(04) COMP-3 VALUE 0.
